    "college-cta3": {
      "type": "college-cta3",
      "blocks": {
        "de14f91a-fced-4145-8a2b-f6c6e01729ce": {
          "type": "Article",
          "settings": {
            "item_switch": true,
            "item_thumb": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Defend.jpg",
            "item_title": "CRICOS",
            "item_tag": "",
            "item_desc": "<p>The Department of Education and Training is responsible for the Commonwealth Register of Institutions and Courses for Overseas Students (CRICOS). Only education providers registered under the ESOS Act and listed in CRICOS can enrol overseas students to study in Australia on a Student VISA. This protects Australia’s reputation for delivering quality education services and the interests of overseas students, by setting minimum standards and providing tuition and financial assurance.<\/p>\n<p>Ella Baché College of Skin and Beauty Therapy is registered with <a href=\"https:\/\/cricos.education.gov.au\/\" target=\"_blank\">CRICOS<\/a>, Provider No: 01474B, to deliver nationally accredited beauty therapy courses for Overseas Students.\n<\/p>",
            "item_btn_text": "",
            "item_btn_url": ""
          }
        },
        "6ba1dc2f-4928-4328-8cf9-9f345f5dd817": {
          "type": "Article",
          "settings": {
            "item_switch": true,
            "item_thumb": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/StairBAW_676d45d5-a370-4793-9b98-4ac15b97bdcd.png",
            "item_title": "ESOS",
            "item_tag": "",
            "item_desc": "<p>The Education Services for Overseas Students (ESOS) framework is a set of regulations related to international students studying in Australia on a Student VISA. Before accepting an offer to study with Ella Bache College, overseas students should be familiar with the ESOS framework. Please read the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.studyinaustralia.gov.au\/english\/australian-education\/education-system\/esos-act\/Education-Services-for-Overseas-Students-Act\" target=\"_blank\">ESOS Student Fact Sheet<\/a> carefully.<\/p>",
            "item_btn_text": "",
            "item_btn_url": ""
          }
        }
      },
